{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE WORLD\u2019S LARGEST POKER GAME IS NOW AVAILABLE ON STEAM!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the world's most popular free-to-download poker game and experience more tables, tournaments, and jackpots than ever before!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FREE CHIPS:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a massive 13,000,000 FREE CHIP welcome bonus! Plus, earn daily rewards of up to\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45,000,000 chips to keep your stack growing and the action rolling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TEXAS HOLD'EM YOUR WAY:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play classic free Texas Hold'em or chase high-stakes jackpots. Enjoy faster tournaments for quicker play. The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635220/extras/faef01151242eed30161cc2f54bffb57.poster.avif?t=1770207133\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635220/extras/faef01151242eed30161cc2f54bffb57.webm?t=1770207133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635220/extras/faef01151242eed30161cc2f54bffb57.mp4?t=1770207133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAY ANYWHERE:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly play across all platforms. Take your poker game wherever you go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FAIR PLAY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zynga Poker\u2019s random generator is officially certified and plays like a real table experience. Put on your poker face, take your online poker games anywhere, and know that you\u2019re getting the true Poker experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MASSIVE VARIETY OF GAMEPLAY:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from SIT-N-GO tournaments, Omaha, Burn \u2018em, Pineapple, Short-Deck Hold\u2019em, casual tables, 5-player or 9-player games, and fast or slow play options. There\u2019s endless gameplay to find your perfect match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635220/extras/85cef6337db753d2dc57d68cf6554b67.poster.avif?t=1770207133\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635220/extras/85cef6337db753d2dc57d68cf6554b67.webm?t=1770207133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635220/extras/85cef6337db753d2dc57d68cf6554b67.mp4?t=1770207133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >POT-LIMIT OMAHA POKER:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a whole new card game! Explosive action with FOUR hole cards! Create bigger and better hands in this exciting poker variant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HIGHER STAKES, BIGGER PAYOUTS:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher buy-ins lead to massive virtual poker chip prizes in every tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SOCIAL POKER EXPERIENCE:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge friends, meet new players, and join the strongest poker community online. Practice your poker face and become a poker star!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635220/extras/d5128639672b23147b52349d87dcc84e.poster.avif?t=1770207133\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635220/extras/d5128639672b23147b52349d87dcc84e.webm?t=1770207133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635220/extras/d5128639672b23147b52349d87dcc84e.mp4?t=1770207133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MULTI-TABLE TOURNAMENTS (MTT) &amp; TRILLIONAIRE MAKER:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against hundreds or thousands of players across multiple tables. The marquee Trillionaire Maker guarantees a first-place prize of TRILLIONS OF CHIPS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LEAGUES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join millions of players worldwide in our online Poker Season competition. Win the most chips to rise to the top and become the Texas Poker champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zynga Poker is the ultimate destination for poker players, card fans, and tournament enthusiasts. Join our exciting poker community today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635220/extras/bc1ff0a9b47da766a36190fdeb6a2ded.poster.avif?t=1770207133\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635220/extras/bc1ff0a9b47da766a36190fdeb6a2ded.webm?t=1770207133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635220/extras/bc1ff0a9b47da766a36190fdeb6a2ded.mp4?t=1770207133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3635220?t=1770207133","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635220/19d45f8bbc86740f54f756257995578dba3b6ccd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770207133","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635220/a849bebecf670ca53f0449b0a2f1b25e3708f7ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770207133","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor